{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q33", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主目前的婚姻状态？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主庚金生于寅月，木旺金囚，但年柱戊辰印星生身，时柱甲申有申金强根，日支子水伤官泄秀。月柱甲寅偏财透干，时柱甲申偏财坐禄，财星旺盛且透出，显示命主在感情上较为主动，但日支子水为伤官，伤官克官（夫星），且月干甲木偏财与日主庚金相冲克，暗示婚姻宫受冲，感情易有波折。\n\n命主为女性，正官为夫星，八字中正官不显，仅藏于年支辰中乙木（正财）和月支寅中丙火（七杀），七杀为偏夫，且寅申冲，婚姻宫不稳定。时柱甲申，申子半合水局，伤官力量增强，对婚姻不利。综合来看，命主早年感情多变动，中年后（约30岁后）大运进入丙辰（正官运），有婚缘机会，但日支子水伤官始终存在，婚姻易有矛盾。\n\n结合台湾地区社会背景及命主年龄（1988年生，现约36岁），此阶段多已进入婚姻，但伤官克官及寅申冲，离婚风险较高。选项中，D（离婚育有子女）更符合命局中婚姻宫受冲、伤官克官且子女星（食伤）旺的组合特征。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q33", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5243, "response_id": "efe03d30-0511-4b08-8310-d9ac769fc015", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 214, "completion_tokens": 331, "total_tokens": 545, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
