{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "对命主之描述？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主为庚金，生于寅月（木旺之时），金处休囚之地。但年柱戊辰为厚土生金，时柱甲申中申金为庚金之根，且申中藏壬水，金有根气。庚金本身代表刚健、骨骼、骨架，通常庚金日主的人骨架较大或身形偏健壮，而非娇小或瘦弱。月柱甲寅木旺，木主肌肉，但木旺克土，土生金之力减弱，金气受制，可能不会过于肥胖，但整体体质偏实。时柱申金为禄神，增强金的力量，故身形更偏向健壮而非微胖。综合判断，命主身材应属健壮类型。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q35", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4442, "response_id": "1bc0de85-fe23-4c51-86ae-36457b6e0011", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 212, "completion_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 383, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 84}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q36", "domain": "study", "question": "命主学历状况为何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，但年柱庚戌、月柱癸未、时柱己未，官杀（土）极重，且未土为燥土，癸水无根，身弱至极。然而，命局中庚金正印透干，且月干癸水比肩帮身，时支未中藏丁火偏财，但整体印星（庚金）得戌土生扶，且日支卯木食神制杀，形成“食神制杀”的格局，主聪明有学识。更重要的是，年柱庚戌为魁罡，月柱癸未为十灵日，时柱己未为华盖，这些神煞均主智慧、学术、技艺。虽然身弱，但印星有力，且食神制杀，代表能通过学识和专业技能获得地位。综合判断，命主学历应较高，但非顶级，结合选项，最符合“高中或专科肄业”的中间层次，但考虑到食神制杀和印星作用，实际可能更高，然而题目选项中最接近且合理的为C（高中或专科肄业），因博士需极强印星和官星配合，此命虽聪慧但身弱，难以支撑极高学历。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q36", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4773, "response_id": "4d3f7616-4305-4225-9e20-e666669b3368", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 213, "completion_tokens": 284, "total_tokens": 497, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 213}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q37", "domain": "career", "question": "命主出社会后的工作？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，需金水帮扶。年柱庚戌，庚金正印透出，月柱癸未，时柱己未，官杀混杂，土重克水，身弱无疑。喜用神为金、水，忌神为火、土。\n\n命局中正印庚金在年干，代表学业、文化、稳定工作，且印星为用，暗示命主适合进入体制内或稳定行业。月柱癸未，比肩帮身，但未土为七杀，时柱己未七杀强旺，官杀代表压力、管理、纪律性工作。日支卯木为食神，食神制杀，有技术或专业能力。\n\n结合大运，命主出社会约在20岁左右（1990年前后），走辛巳大运（约1989-1999年），辛金偏印生身，巳火为财，但巳未拱火，压力较大。此运中，印星发挥作用，适合进入稳定单位，如国企或学校。但命局官杀重，更倾向管理或技术岗位，而非纯教学。\n\n综合判断，命主更可能进入工厂（因官杀代表工业、制造），后转入国企（印星代表体制内稳定），符合A选项特征。B选项学校老师需食伤明显且印星清透，但此命官杀重，教学非首选。C大企业高管需财官有力且身强，此命身弱难担。D做小生意需食伤生财，但命局印星为用，不宜经商。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q37", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5823, "response_id": "9330b6e7-1f4b-435c-9a2e-d472b57d000b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 225, "completion_tokens": 359, "total_tokens": 584, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 97}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q38", "domain": "career", "question": "命主早年一直在北京生活，直到哪个年龄有搬迁大变动，从北京去厦门工作？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：庚戌年、癸未月、癸卯日、己未时。日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，喜金水为用神，忌火土。\n\n命主早年在北京（北方属水，为喜用之地），运势平稳。大运排法：年干庚为阳，男性顺排。月柱癸未，顺排大运为：甲申、乙酉、丙戌、丁亥、戊子、己丑、庚寅、辛卯。起运年龄：出生在7月22日，距下一个节气立秋（8月8日左右）约17天，按三天折一年，约5岁8个月起运，即约6岁起运。\n\n大运依次为：\n- 6-15岁：甲申（金水，吉）\n- 16-25岁：乙酉（金水，吉）\n- 26-35岁：丙戌（火土，忌神，但戌为燥土，且丙火透出，易有变动）\n- 36-45岁：丁亥（火水，丁火为忌，但亥水为喜，吉凶参半）\n\n问题问“搬迁大变动，从北京去厦门工作”。厦门在南方（属火），为忌神之地。搬迁至南方，必在火土旺的大运或流年。丙戌大运（26-35岁）火土旺，最可能在此运中发生。具体流年：26岁为1996年丙子，27岁1997丁丑，28岁1998戊寅，29岁1999己卯，30岁2000庚辰，31岁2001辛巳。其中2001辛巳年，巳火为南方，且与大运丙戌火土相生，最符合“去南方”的变动。此年命主31岁，属于26-35岁区间，即选项A（27-31岁）的末尾。\n\n但需注意，选项A为27-31岁，而31岁正好在区间内。若严格按虚岁或周岁，命主1970年生，2001年实岁31岁，虚岁32岁，但通常命理以周岁或虚岁皆可，此处按实岁31岁，属于A。\n\n再检查其他选项：32-36岁为丁亥大运初期，亥水为喜，且丁火弱，变动可能性小；37-41岁为戊子大运，子水为喜，更不可能去南方；42-46岁为己丑大运，土旺，但此时已过中年，且大运土重，但问题强调“早年”，故排除。\n\n综上，最符合的是A。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q38", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6999, "response_id": "78dc2cf7-d6d6-4a78-9d1d-107b410a2646", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 231, "completion_tokens": 584, "total_tokens": 815, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens"